  "visualDNA": {
    "Overview": "Solarpunk is a sub-genre of speculative fiction which imagines positive futures driven by clean energy without scarcity. The solarpunk aesthetic typically utilizes natural colors, bright greens and blues, and allusions to diverse cultural origins. Examples of this aesthetic include the depiction of Wakanda in Marvel Studios' Black Panther, Auroa in Tom Clancy's Ghost Recon Breakpoint, and some Studio Ghibli movies, particularly Castle in the Sky and Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind."
  },
